{"id":"bestiame","lemma":"bestiame","pos":"noun","rank":3784,"glosses":["cattle and sheep etc. considered as an agricultural commodity","stock, livestock"],"ipa":"/besˈtja.me/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bestiami"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-bestiame.wav","examples":[{"text":"Abbiamo dieci pezzi di bestiame.","en":"We have ten head of cattle.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"piece, chunk","l":"pezzo"},{"g":"of"},null]},{"text":"Il bestiame è morto di fame.","en":"The cattle starved to death.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"dead man"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"Hanno rubato cavalli e bestiame.","en":"They stole horses and cattle.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"rubato"},{"g":"horse","l":"cavallo"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Il bestiame stava pascolando nel campo.","en":"Cattle were grazing in the field.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"field"}]},{"text":"Io allevo bestiame.","en":"I raise cattle.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]}]}